{"id": "4fd22242-fe57-4df3-918b-3519b3203202", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T14:31:46.808264", "source": "user", "parent_id": "eb6b53db-51fe-4c54-8f1c-7b254a4cd7ea", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"We need a design-only answer (no execution) to: Does the MDGEN model accurately recover fast timestep dynamics (e.g., torsion-angle oscillations) that are missing in subsampled molecular dynamics trajectories?\\n\\nDo not run or fabricate any experiment. For this turn, please only deliver three things:\\n1) Input/repository inspection: Inspect /workspace (e.g., track.md and any other files) and report what is actually present — any MDGEN-related code, model descriptions, documentation, data files, or trajectory formats — so we know what the design can rely on.\\n2) A proposed approach (a sketch, not the full solution): how you would structure an experiment comparing MDGEN output against subsampled versus high-frequency reference trajectories, including candidate metrics for fast-timescale recovery (e.g., torsion-angle autocorrelation / oscillation frequencies), and what controls would be needed.\\n3) Consequential assumptions or uncertainties: list the key unknown setup details (expected empirical outcome, available data formats, runtime budget, metric definitions, what \\\"accurate recovery\\\" means) and state how you propose to treat each one as a stated assumption.\\n\\nDo not yet produce the final design; we will review the approach before proceeding.\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"Does the MDGEN model accurately recover the fast timestep dynamics (e.g., oscillations in torsion angles) that are missing in subsampled molecular dynamics trajectories?\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 224, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null, "reasoning_content": null, "thinking_blocks": [], "responses_reasoning_item": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "critic_result": null, "kind": "MessageEvent"}
